# Settings for rnote, saved with 'dconf-changes rnote --save'.
# Loaded by rnote.nix as a dconf default. Comments and hand-made
# edits survive the next --save; delete a line to stop keeping it.
#
# Rnote has no config file: it keeps everything in dconf, in one long
# line per setting. Not kept on purpose (dconf-changes shows them, they
# were deleted here): window-width, window-height, is-maximized and
# selected-workspace-index (where the window was last time), and
# workspace-list (folder shortcuts - those hold /home/<you> paths and
# would be wrong on another machine).

